                                "sense_id": "0f7c7d45-f34e-312c-86a0-8bdc78d72498",
                                "text": "He was intent on an audacious, immitigable, and supernatural revenge."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "12656f51-c56c-4130-9239-c24f24a8ffc8",
                                "sense_id": "0f7c7d45-f34e-312c-86a0-8bdc78d72498",
                                "text": "\"Oh, my dear son, the plague in this town is raging with immitigable violence, and I am always fancying you will come home infected with it. […]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "76068ef0-1741-401b-8e90-229c3d527103",
                                "sense_id": "0f7c7d45-f34e-312c-86a0-8bdc78d72498",
                                "text": "\"[…] Matter is running down and the universe itself will one day become extinct. An everlasting and immitigable nothingness, in the void of black and absolute−\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
